"Currently, the NPU supports the deployment of the following common training and inference backends on Ascend 950PR&950DT products. You can directly obtain the released images using our :doc:`Ascend image instructions <dockerfile_build_guidance>`, or perform a custom installation using the following sections.\n"
""

