msgid ""
"关键版本支持与依赖\n"
"^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Key Version Support and Dependencies\n"
"^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
""

msgid ""
"依赖          版本                                               说明                                                       \n"
""
msgstr ""
"Dependency          Version                                               Description\n"
""

msgid ""
"CANN          ``9.2.1``                                         CANN软件，帮助开发者实现在昇腾软硬件平台上开发和运行AI业务\n"
"Python        ``3.12``                                          Python版本                                                 \n"
"torch         ``2.10.0``                                        PyTorch 深度学习框架基础包                                 \n"
"torch_npu     ``2.10.0.post7``                                  NPU PyTorch 适配插件\n"
"torchvision   ``0.25.0``                                        PyTorch 图像处理库\n"
"torchaudio    ``2.10.0``                                        PyTorch 音频处理库\n"
"triton-ascend ``3.6.0.post2``                                   NPU Triton 适配\n"
"transformers  ``5.14.1``                                        Hugging Face 大模型库，提供模型架构与预训练权重\n"
"xgrammar      ``>=0.2.1,<1.0.0``                                 vLLM 结构化输出依赖\n"
"vLLM          ``0.30.0``                                        高性能 LLM 推理与服务引擎\n"
"vLLM-Ascend   ``0.30.0``                                        NPU vLLM 后端适配\n"
"Megatron-LM   ``core_v0.18.2``                                  大规模分布式训练框架\n"
"MindSpeed     ``26.2.0_core_r0.18.0``                           Megatron-LM 在昇腾 NPU 上的适配和优化组件\n"
""
msgstr ""
"CANN          ``9.2.1``                                         CANN software that helps developers develop and run AI applications on Ascend software and hardware platforms\n"
"Python        ``3\n"
""

msgid ""
"   MegatronAdaptor 使用 ``26.2.0_core_r0.18.0``。\n"
"   MindSpeed-Bridge 使用 ``26.2.0_v0.5.0``。\n"
"   TransformerEngineNPU 使用 ``26.2.0_release_v2.17``。\n"
"   MindSpeed-Ops 使用 ``26.2.0``。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   MegatronAdaptor uses ``26.2.0_core_r0.18.0``.\n"
"   MindSpeed-Bridge uses ``26.2.0_v0.5.0``.\n"
"   TransformerEngineNPU uses ``26.2.0_release_v2.17``.\n"
"   MindSpeed-Ops uses ``26.2.0``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   本表的运行依赖与 `vLLM-Ascend 0.30.0 安装依赖 <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/releases/v0.30.0/requirements.txt>`_\n"
"   对齐；xgrammar 使用 `vLLM 0.30.0 的依赖范围 <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/v0.30.0/requirements/common.txt>`_。\n"
"   使用 triton-ascend 提供的 Triton 实现，无需另行安装 triton 软件包。\n"
"   当前两个上游存在 FastAPI 约束冲突：vLLM 要求 ``>=0.133.0,<0.137.0``，vLLM-Ascend 要求 ``<0.124.0``，\n"
"   没有同时满足两者的版本。需先解决该冲突，再使用 ``pip check`` 检查最终环境并验证运行兼容性。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The running dependencies in this table align with the `vLLM-Ascend 0.30.0 installation dependencies <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/releases/v0.30.0/requirements.txt>`_; xgrammar uses the `vLLM 0.30.0 dependency range <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/v0.30.0/requirements/common.txt>`_.\n"
"   Use the Triton implementation provided by triton-ascend; you do not need to install the triton package separately.\n"
"   Currently, a FastAPI constraint conflict exists between the two upstream repositories: vLLM requires ``>=0.133.0,<0.137.0``, and vLLM-Ascend requires ``<0.124.0``,\n"
"   No version satisfies both requirements. Resolve this conflict first. Then use ``pip check`` to check the final environment and verify running compatibility.\n"
""

msgid ""
"Megatron 训练后端还需安装以下 Bridge 组件：\n"
""
msgstr ""
